  "category": "Power & interface",
  "prefix": "U",
  "description": "The common adjustable LM2596 step-down module: input 4.5-40 V on IN+/IN-, output from 1.25 V up to about 1.5 V below the input on OUT+/OUT- (OUT- is IN-), up to 3 A; turn its trimmer while running by dragging it or with the wheel. Averaged: no switching ripple; the input current is the output power over 85 %",
